iculty/hard} :question/id #uuid "af9cdeb5-005f-5853-99d0-a41f27f661dd" :question/math-academy-id "q-129052" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}5x-8y+z=-1 \\\\ 9y=2 \\\\ 3x-y-8z=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}5x-8y+z=-1 \\\\ 0x+9y+0z=2 \\\\ 3x-y-8z=-4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}5 & \\,\\,\\,-8 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 9 & 0 \\\\ 3 & \\,\\,\\,-1 & \\,\\,\\,-8\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186370794 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "320f89d6-07ad-5680-ae1f-b971fb8190ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 0 & -7\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370796} {:answer/id #uuid "73facfbe-bcd3-5e55-a85f-cc0ef860e347" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 8 & -7 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370797} {:answer/id #uuid "c72cf8e8-0d34-56d5-9ff5-49568de10d0b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & -7 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370798} {:answer/id #uuid "8b5eb46c-7799-5df1-9489-f0ae15eda8a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 1 & -7\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370799} {:answer/id #uuid "67668cda-ae4a-5b50-a16e-f3550830905a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 8\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370800}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "320f89d6-07ad-5680-ae1f-b971fb8190ed" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 0 & -7\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370796} :answer-field/id #uuid "9eeb796c-1210-5641-bc3d-977d7945442f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370795}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "38609ae6-5d9d-581b-ab26-5d551f7005c5" :question/math-academy-id "q-129122" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}4x-y=4 \\\\ 8x=-7\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient: \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4x-y=4 \\\\ 8x+0y=-7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 \\\\ 8 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 8 & 0 & -7\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186370801 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "658f847c-8811-51d4-8cb2-368aee3dc5cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -9 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370803} {:answer/id #uuid "cffb9d1b-a544-5e34-a7d7-508130638845" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 9 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370804} {:answer/id #uuid "6e930fce-82f3-58ee-b408-40a3e2f09690" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -9 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370805} {:answer/id #uuid "efc8ae37-4bd1-534d-9090-0c1de9b79116" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 9 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370806} {:answer/id #uuid "ce9ae27f-09b1-5f39-bde9-7550d35aa4fd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -9 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370807}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "658f847c-8811-51d4-8cb2-368aee3dc5cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -9 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370803} :answer-field/id #uuid "08cbd4bf-4ccd-5592-a555-39d2cea6405d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370802}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "024bf297-45a9-5702-b9d5-89e1b4d12ff9" :question/math-academy-id "q-129124" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2y=5-x \\\\ 5x-9y+1=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x+2y=5 \\\\ 5x-9y=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -9\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & -9 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186370808 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "73bc626e-7188-5397-adc7-fc4305ccc8a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}8x+y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370810} {:answer/id #uuid "db771146-06d1-5a4c-ac91-0b48182b9775" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}8y=6 \\\\ x+4y=-9\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370811} {:answer/id #uuid "a7f319da-d903-5d23-8774-0c7e3247858f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}8y=6 \\\\ x+4y=9\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370812} {:answer/id #uuid "0eb93432-e0bc-5386-9340-1dc3a6ce49eb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=9\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370813} {:answer/id #uuid "e6e777c3-e47d-536d-8a65-5ad5faaefeec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370814}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e6e777c3-e47d-536d-8a65-5ad5faaefeec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370814} :answer-field/id #uuid "9b46a81a-9bf1-56c8-ace7-e6b532441ca3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370809}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "10f47672-b02f-5835-a498-94f2d2a69a14" :question/math-academy-id "q-129129" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 1 & -9\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}0x+8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186370815 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1dd3cf4f-5373-5876-a92d-61fb2ccbba9e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}-8x+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5x+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370817} {:answer/id #uuid "46ceb2c7-979b-559e-adf9-c0d0c0f5c8da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ x+5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370818} {:answer/id #uuid "592d0b7b-cf3b-5756-b325-b03e009fb36e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370819} {:answer/id #uuid "4c59102b-f9a1-5f01-b28b-12ef14f72417" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}-8x+4y=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5x+\\frac{2}{3}y=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370820} {:answer/id #uuid "34a7f8eb-12e8-5a80-b8f7-4db58c6b20a9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}-8y+4z=\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=-8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=-6\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370821}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "592d0b7b-cf3b-5756-b325-b03e009fb36e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370819} :answer-field/id #uuid "0975bfa4-67ce-58b9-bf58-a85394bbb4ee" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370816}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "f0c417e1-432e-591b-889d-c01227fedeb7" :question/math-academy-id "q-129133" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & -8 & 4 & -\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 0 & 5 & \\frac{2}{3} & 8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{1}{3} & 4 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}0x-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 0x+5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-8y+4z=-\\frac{7}{4} \\\\ 5y+\\frac{2}{3}z=8 \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}x+\\frac{1}{3}y+4z=6.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186370822 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0758b63b-6214-5eef-9545-65136232fcdd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 9 & 4 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370824} {:answer/id #uuid "ca43d977-7e08-5a66-bb2c-b9f4626885fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 9 & -4 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370825} {:answer/id #uuid "5de2dc8e-6e30-5493-806d-c3d67a882bf5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 9 \\\\ 3 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370826} {:answer/id #uuid "54246d18-6999-5be1-8915-ec1350c5ea32" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 9 & 1 & -4\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370827} {:answer/id #uuid "32c5e5e3-05c8-5568-acbb-3f962fcec938" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 9 & -4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370828}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ca43d977-7e08-5a66-bb2c-b9f4626885fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 9 & -4 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370825} :answer-field/id #uuid "1292eb1f-7f9d-5922-a28b-7931f45ad07e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370823}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c4f73212-7eee-56ad-bfa4-e71b699e6af7" :question/math-academy-id "q-129137" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}p+3q=2 \\\\ 9p-4q=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order $p,q$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 9 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 9 & -4 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186370829 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb13e9d9-19f0-5f39-b9f8-e6e2f8fac433" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Coefficient Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a77d9b4a-d2f4-5ff2-a94a-8644ff23e0a8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370831} {:answer/id #uuid "17a9bf8a-d194-55ef-b170-c1b3085ee591" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370832} {:answer/id #uuid "fdafd3ce-285d-57cf-b973-eb0c8c1a4bc3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370833} {:answer/id #uuid "c681b597-0bca-5f6d-b992-3688bc63d394" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370834} {:answer/id #uuid "5f88f3fa-eca3-5be3-b24f-6bfc95e1af16" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370835}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "17a9bf8a-d194-55ef-b170-c1b3085ee591" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370832} :answer-field/id #uuid "b1600478-8823-5453-b577-9de3c072fd25" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370830}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "164ad5b2-2c1d-5473-9bf9-de2ba7029b1c" :question/math-academy-id "q-141155" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-x+5y=2 \\\\ 2x+y=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186370836 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e5be995f-b506-5ee9-96d6-d85fe6e3165e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+z=-6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370838} {:answer/id #uuid "13b5238c-2a28-5e1f-9806-c1c81333d182" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x-2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370839} {:answer/id #uuid "6eb4477f-aa7a-5635-a221-0003b71fe051" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x-y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370840} {:answer/id #uuid "76cea8a5-964d-5b05-a59c-72483b85cb21" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+2z=6 \\\\ 3x-\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370841} {:answer/id #uuid "3440190b-4fe3-5c74-b7da-e8f9627d6fd4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370842}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3440190b-4fe3-5c74-b7da-e8f9627d6fd4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370842} :answer-field/id #uuid "0dfe21fc-9e0b-5eea-b1b9-dbdcf6d1b1af" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370837}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "1700e511-a4e7-5eb1-bf8e-366e57339d0a" :question/math-academy-id "q-20367" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 & 1 & 1 & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4} & 0 & 2 & 6 \\\\ 3 & \\frac{1}{2} & 6 & \\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x-0y+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}4x+y+z=\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}x+2z=6 \\\\ 3x+\\frac{1}{2}y+6z=\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060321 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uu