ists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299089 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a System of Linear Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c5b80452-12b9-5ea6-89d8-e660225e9277" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299091} {:answer/id #uuid "e33c94ee-d059-5f9f-b841-d2d8cb9947c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299092} {:answer/id #uuid "a97786ff-7ca3-542d-9ad3-5612753e7c48" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299093} {:answer/id #uuid "f3efe0ef-e145-5648-a1ca-631fbb55b726" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299094} {:answer/id #uuid "a2e5a4cf-c626-571e-9739-342e8312b273" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299095}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a97786ff-7ca3-542d-9ad3-5612753e7c48" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299093} :answer-field/id #uuid "c0aaedcf-8f9e-55a6-ad72-25a43e5ddd91" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299090}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "671bb0ea-172d-5bcd-9af7-fde2cdb49f9b" :question/math-academy-id "q-71722" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-3=2y \\\\ 1+y=-2x\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=3 \\\\ 2x+y=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186370843 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bc159a21-ae8e-5ecf-b33b-77fa0a953d84" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+y+2z=1\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370845} {:answer/id #uuid "240c8fb1-a4a8-50aa-930e-ca2010ec45c6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+2y-4z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370846} {:answer/id #uuid "f100c9c8-73ff-5dca-b7b0-f1d51076a3b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370847} {:answer/id #uuid "4c715691-36cf-5322-8441-2c150d0cb089" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=1 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=2\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370848} {:answer/id #uuid "c1c538b3-109b-5b0d-8e73-06b6a4c7f4c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ x+y+z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370849}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f100c9c8-73ff-5dca-b7b0-f1d51076a3b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370847} :answer-field/id #uuid "7a45712c-de57-594b-ae6c-bc03c7e4efb2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370844}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "3383609b-6f13-5900-9557-d8bf919557fa" :question/math-academy-id "q-71723" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x+4y-2z=3 \\\\ -x+y-z=2 \\\\ 2x+2y+z=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299096 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the System of Equations Associated With an Augmented Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fd07f452-0633-5460-9442-d326bf925eb6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ 2x-3y=-18\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299098} {:answer/id #uuid "35795abf-e7a2-5919-b638-5fc6256411e4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}-5x-y=10 \\\\ -3x-2y=-5\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299099} {:answer/id #uuid "10e6f7b9-0cdd-5b87-a45d-70e89c39842b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=1 \\\\ -2x-3y=-5\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299100} {:answer/id #uuid "a9bdcbbf-378b-5a67-9cb2-d662542dd25d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299101} {:answer/id #uuid "41578edf-3c23-5b5f-982a-492b8f89b9f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ 2x-3y=-16\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299102}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a9bdcbbf-378b-5a67-9cb2-d662542dd25d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299101} :answer-field/id #uuid "36b93888-4be1-504b-b8c2-f8ea03f231ce" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299097}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "fccffcb6-cabb-5be9-bcba-30754f9d0e4e" :question/math-academy-id "q-71728" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & 10 \\\\ -2 & -3 & -15\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-5y=10 \\\\ -2x-3y=-15\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186370850 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00bb0b6b-fc27-51cd-a13a-7d924ed6e69a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370852} {:answer/id #uuid "6b5c18c3-dd2a-53a9-9991-83055d01d4e9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370853} {:answer/id #uuid "5d532036-d456-5c56-aae9-13a2151d57a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370854} {:answer/id #uuid "aee9e74f-dd97-58b2-a7f6-ab5a9cc1de0b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370855} {:answer/id #uuid "b7f8c390-720d-5b12-b2e0-b94de905bbb5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370856}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b7f8c390-720d-5b12-b2e0-b94de905bbb5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370856} :answer-field/id #uuid "d6f4dae1-57e0-5391-85f5-475d7c560f4c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370851}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "733b50b2-4cd8-5259-8e15-8577ebba1d9c" :question/math-academy-id "q-71731" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}=-1 \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order ${x}_{1},{x}_{2}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299103 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e35c8f0c-a7f5-5565-922b-fb17c30a5cd2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299105} {:answer/id #uuid "651fee39-5130-508b-a1e9-34741f00649b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299106} {:answer/id #uuid "96bd09a1-b4b0-57fc-9cab-85c2467937ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299107} {:answer/id #uuid "0a3f3600-9316-5dc5-99a9-de44153fb00c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 & -5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299108} {:answer/id #uuid "697efabd-62d8-528d-8ac0-420ee13fb911" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299109}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "697efabd-62d8-528d-8ac0-420ee13fb911" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299109} :answer-field/id #uuid "b3249609-b27f-5fe9-bb12-dc6539b4d474" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299104}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "39cd7b44-484f-5137-a0a3-95f76a9d1baa" :question/math-academy-id "q-71733" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}=-5 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}=-3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order ${x}_{1},{x}_{2}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186370857 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Augmented Matrix of a Linear System With Variables Other Than x, y, z"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1103ed34-4d7b-5903-918b-866afdeb28a6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370859} {:answer/id #uuid "1b0efe35-31d7-5eff-be30-ccde9407f796" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370860} {:answer/id #uuid "bf25ff89-86a7-52af-9645-b89068adafbe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370861} {:answer/id #uuid "6fcfd152-77eb-535d-8cc5-6693c1307366" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370862} {:answer/id #uuid "22d5c4e8-a2a7-5a53-b2af-18026d9aeaec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370863}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "22d5c4e8-a2a7-5a53-b2af-18026d9aeaec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370863} :answer-field/id #uuid "ca53d8d4-2e44-59a5-82db-f9534abedfd0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186370858}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "7672ad95-6ea9-52fb-8430-2348e98b218a" :question/math-academy-id "q-71734" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}u-v=-1 \\\\ -u-v=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order $u,v$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$"}]}
